===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|de|gmh|droschel}}, from {{inh|de|goh|drōscala}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*þrustalǭ}}, possibly altered from or a diminutive of {{m|gem-pro|*þurstaz}}. The modern consonantism is [[Central German|Central]] and [[Low German]] (compare {{cog|gml|drōsle}}, from {{cog|osx|thrōsla}}). Compare {{cog|en|throstle}}.

